      "explanation": "<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online Mathematics - Hyperbola Question 6 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l9425up6/dc27503c-bd4e-4d09-860d-9ae4012198f5/27fbc990-494f-11ed-8700-75ceab41d301/file-1l9425up7.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>From property we know, tangent and normal is bisector of the angle between focal radii.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -4